      "raw_text": "朋友在賣場上班，說今天接到通知要先把泰山某批沙拉油收起來，不知道發生什麼事。我家上週剛買一桶，味道好像有點怪，有人也遇到嗎？",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 2,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_002",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/002",
      "author_ref": "user_002",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T10:05:00Z",
      "raw_text": "轉貼：朋友在賣場上班，說今天接到通知要先把泰山某批沙拉油收起來……有人也遇到嗎？",
      "source_relation": "repost",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": "post_001"
    },
    {
      "stage": 3,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_003",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/003",
      "author_ref": "user_003",
      "published_at": "2026-07-01T01:40:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我在蝦皮買的福壽大豆沙拉油，瓶身標示原料批號 315-1150404。今天看到說中聯油脂的大豆油驗出苯駢芘超標，福壽是不是也用中聯的油？已經開了兩瓶，很擔心。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 4,
      "provider": "fda_tw",
      "source_id": "fda_20260701",
      "url": "https://www.fda.gov.tw/tc/newsContent.aspx?cid=4&id=t634379",
      "author_ref": null,
      "published_at": "2026-07-01T08:00:00Z",
      "raw_text": "中聯油脂批號 315-1150404 大豆沙拉油約 1,300 公噸苯駢芘 8.1 μg/kg，超過限量 2.0；流向福懋 588 公噸、福壽 421 公噸、泰山 291 公噸；首波 15 項油品下架。",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 5,
      "provider": "fda_tw",
      "source_id": "fda_20260707",
      "url": "https://www.fda.gov.tw/tc/newsContent.aspx?cid=4&id=t634443",
      "author_ref": null,
      "published_at": "2026-07-07T09:00:00Z",
      "raw_text": "擴大為所有使用受影響原料製成之食品，不論比例，7/8 24 時前全面下架。前一日 7/6 公告已擴為 360 家、18 項產品、30 批號。",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 6,
      "provider": "news",
      "source_id": "cna_20260723",
      "url": "https://www.cna.com.tw/news/ahel/202607230245.aspx",
      "author_ref": null,
      "published_at": "2026-07-23T09:04:00Z",
      "raw_text": "全面檢驗結案後，除已知 7 批不合格油品外未新增問題批號；19 批合格油品由泰山、福懋及福壽製成共 501 項產品，可重新上架。",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 101,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_001",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/001",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_001",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T03:15:00Z",
      "raw_text": "昨晚在新北買的泰山大豆沙拉油，開封後聞起來怪怪的。店員說可能只是保存問題，但我擔心是不是有批次正在回收，有人知道嗎？",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 102,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_002",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/002",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_002",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T03:48:00Z",
      "raw_text": "轉貼：昨晚在新北買的泰山大豆沙拉油，開封後聞起來怪怪的……有人知道嗎？",
      "source_relation": "repost",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": "post_showcase_001"
    },
    {
      "stage": 103,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_003",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/003",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_003",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T05:05:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我在台中買的福壽大豆沙拉油瓶身也有原料批號 315-1150404。賣場今天先把同批商品移到後台，客服說還在等正式通知。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 104,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_004",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/004",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_004",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T05:32:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我家的福壽大豆沙拉油也是原料批號 315-1150404，已經用了半瓶，味道和外觀都正常，所以不一定每瓶都有問題吧。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 105,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_005",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/005",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_005",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T06:10:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我剛問品牌客服，對方說原料批號 315-1150404 沒有使用中聯油脂，也不在回收範圍內。先不要看到同品牌就恐慌。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 106,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_006",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/006",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_006",
      "published_at": "2026-06-30T06:45:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我的補充：我家這瓶標的是 315-1150398，跟原貼提到的批次可能不同。轉貼：昨晚在新北買的泰山大豆沙拉油，開封後聞起來怪怪的……",
      "source_relation": "repost",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": "post_showcase_001"
    },
    {
      "stage": 107,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_007",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/007",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_007",
      "published_at": "2026-07-01T08:20:00Z",
      "raw_text": "食藥署已經證實泰山所有食用油都有問題，平台上的泰山油品應該全部下架。",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 108,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_008",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/008",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_008",
      "published_at": "2026-07-01T09:05:00Z",
      "raw_text": "我買的泰山玄米油運送時瓶蓋破了，整箱漏油，賣家一直沒有回覆。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 109,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_009",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/009",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_009",
      "published_at": "2026-07-07T09:20:00Z",
      "raw_text": "店家通知我，使用受影響大豆油製作的調理食品也要先下架。我買的罐頭標示用了福壽原料，但包裝上沒有原料批號。",
      "source_relation": "independent_report",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    },
    {
      "stage": 110,
      "provider": "threads",
      "source_id": "post_showcase_010",
      "url": "https://example.test/post/showcase/010",
      "author_ref": "showcase_user_010",
      "published_at": "2026-07-23T09:30:00Z",
      "raw_text": "新聞說 501 項產品可以重新上架，代表泰山、福懋和福壽的油現在全部都安全了，之前下架的商品可以直接恢復販售。",
      "source_relation": "original",
      "duplicate_of_source_id": null
    }
